assertion  XBD.stdlib.h.009
anchor     basedefs/stdlib.h.html#DESCRIPTION/_Exit
class      required
says       <stdlib.h> declares _Exit(), abort(), abs(), aligned_alloc(),
           at_quick_exit(), atexit(), atof(), atoi(), atol(), atoll(),
           bsearch(), calloc(), div(), exit(), free(), getenv(),
           getsubopt(), labs(), ldiv(), llabs(), lldiv(), malloc(),
           mblen(), mbstowcs(), mbtowc(), mkdtemp(), mkstemp(), qsort(),
           quick_exit(), rand(), realloc(), realpath(), setenv(),
           srand(), strtod(), strtof(), strtol(), strtold(), strtoll(),
           strtoul(), strtoull(), system(), unsetenv(), wcstombs(),
           wctomb() with the prototypes the page gives.
test       t/009-functions.c
nomutant   compile-time check of header content; needs the Tier 0 header mutants

